      <p data-kid=\"1-7-3-1-3\" data-name=\"state text\">\n                    Search by username to start one.\n                </p>\n                <span class=\"state-action\" data-kid=\"1-7-3-1-4\" data-name=\"state action link\">\n                    Search\n                </span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"state-cell\" data-kid=\"1-7-3-2\" data-name=\"state cell\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-message-circle\" data-kid=\"1-7-3-2-1\" data-name=\"state icon\">\n                </i>\n                <h3 data-kid=\"1-7-3-2-2\" data-name=\"state title\">\n                    No messages yet\n                </h3>\n                <p data-kid=\"1-7-3-2-3\" data-name=\"state text\">\n                    Write the first message.\n                </p>\n                <span class=\"state-action\" data-kid=\"1-7-3-2-4\" data-name=\"state action link\">\n                    Write message\n                </span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"state-cell loading\" data-kid=\"1-7-3-3\" data-name=\"state cell\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-loader-2\" data-kid=\"1-7-3-3-1\" data-name=\"state icon\">\n                </i>\n                <div class=\"skeleton-line\" data-kid=\"1-7-3-3-2\" data-name=\"skeleton line\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"skeleton-line short\" data-kid=\"1-7-3-3-3\" data-name=\"skeleton line\">\n                </div>\n                <p data-kid=\"1-7-3-3-4\" data-name=\"state text\">\n                    Loading messages\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"state-cell error\" data-kid=\"1-7-3-4\" data-name=\"state cell\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-alert-circle\" data-kid=\"1-7-3-4-1\" data-name=\"state icon\">\n                </i>\n                <h3 data-kid=\"1-7-3-4-2\" data-name=\"state title\">\n                    Couldn’t load messages\n                </h3>\n                <p data-kid=\"1-7-3-4-3\" data-name=\"state text\">\n                    Your saved messages are still here.\n                </p>\n                <span class=\"state-action\" data-kid=\"1-7-3-4-4\" data-name=\"state action link\">\n                    Try again\n                </span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"state-cell\" data-kid=\"1-7-3-5\" data-name=\"state cell\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-photo-off\" data-kid=\"1-7-3-5-1\" data-name=\"state icon\">\n                </i>\n                <h3 data-kid=\"1-7-3-5-2\" data-name=\"state title\">\n                    No shared media\n                </h3>\n                <p data-kid=\"1-7-3-5-3\" data-name=\"state text\">\n                    Photos will appear here.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"state-cell\" data-kid=\"1-7-3-6\" data-name=\"state cell\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-users-minus\" data-kid=\"1-7-3-6-1\" data-name=\"state icon\">\n                </i>\n                <h3 data-kid=\"1-7-3-6-2\" data-name=\"state title\">\n                    No members match\n                </h3>\n                <p data-kid=\"1-7-3-6-3\" data-name=\"state text\">\n                    Try a different name.\n                </p>\n                <span class=\"state-action\" data-kid=\"1-7-3-6-4\" data-name=\"state action link\">\n                    Clear search\n                </span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"note\" data-kid=\"1-7-4\" data-name=\"section note\">\n            One palette. One rail. No false presence, delivery, or security claims. All primary flows remain recognizably YOKOSU and ready for Compose translation.\n        </div>\n    </section>\n</div>\n",
